# JWT authentication, input validation

## auth.middleware.js
- is the user logged in ?

## role.middleware.js
- (runs after auth middleware)
- Does this logged-in user have permission to do this ?

## company.middleware.js
- Users can access only their company's data.

## index.js
- instead of importing each middleware separatly everywhere.
- you import them from one place.

